is type of  equal contract between a devil  and a human nevertheless noct doesn't  waste any time dwelling on the deep  philosophical meaning  of this event he explains that the  contract ritual was just the first step  of asta's training and now austen liba  must take their training to the next  level the real test for asta and liba  will be to try and work together to  defeat  noct himself and as he explains their  next  task to them noct is engulfed by his  demonic  darkness he suddenly manifests what we  can assume  is his full power devil form it is  definitely a cool looking devil form and  it's safe to say that knocked is about  to test the limits of asta  and liba's resolve and that is how this  fast-paced and info-packed chapter ends  the battle between austin and liba  really is over  and their contract has been made on  equal terms  the two of them will now work together  as a team  and together they will get a chance to  honor their mother's memory  but at the same time their training is  not over yet  in fact the main part of their training  has only just begun  they must now face a much more  experienced  devil magic user and judging by what we  know about  knocked so far i don't think that he is  about to go easy  on asta and liba i loved the brotherly  bonding between osta and leva  and i can't wait to see what new powers  and abilities they will unlock  now that they are working together asta  was already strong when he was just  using a fragment of liba's anti-magic  power  so i am absolutely stoked to find out  everything that the two of them are  going to be able to do  now with that said i am also looking  forward to learning more about  knocked devil and about his shadow magic  after all he is the vice captain of the  black bulls  he is a spymaster and an expert devil  user  but we still don't know the full extent  of his power not even  close if tabitha decides to show us asta  and liba versus knocked  in detail instead of say just skipping  to something else in the next chapter  then we can look forward to learning a  lot more about both  shadow magic and anti-magic i am so  excited because both of these powers  seem to be some of the strongest and  most useful abilities  in all of black clover let me know what  you guys think  did you enjoy the bonding between asta  and liba as much as i did  and what do you think noct still has  planned for the two of them  how much stronger is asta now going to  become  and will it be enough to save yami don't  forget to leave your input  down in the comments below if you  enjoyed this video and you want to see  more black lover content right here on  the channel  please leave a like to let me know it  really does help and if you're new to  anime pro  or maybe you just haven't subscribed  make this the video that you subscribe  and hit that notification bell to turn  on all notifications  even though it's annoying you really  have to go through the trouble of  hitting that bell  and then selecting the option that says  all if you don't do that you're gonna  miss a ton of our videos even if you are  subscribed  it's just how youtube works you can also  hit me up on twitter  and instagram at anime uproar  a big thank you to all of our anime  uproar patrons who make videos like this  one possible  special thank you to alpha sigma and  liam thompson disciples  of lord tuigo himself and i can't forget  our  the one tier patrons the ones who stand  above  all other clans including ingrata  the world acquired respect pate hepha  jonathan king rathuing deora red-haired  raven  emperor otaku thomas jones kin mano  admirath  and chris torley finally thank you to  all of our pro hero tier patrons  including the one and only gilgamesh  nothing but a fan  steelers anatoly kazatsky cricket xp joe  stanton  very gucci jessica califond alicia octor  hinokami in water bonnie parks florian  joanne garcia  mcshamus deadly saint and high school  dxd73  if you enjoy our videos and you feel  that they provide value for you consider  supporting us  on patreon even a single dollar will  give you access to our patron exclusive  discord  and your name will appear in our videos  along with these  amazing people as always thank you guys  so much for watching and until next time  see ya space cowboys  [Music]  you


